�	Ste Birmania enas nearos kallitekhnes, o opoios me ta tragoudia tou epitithetai sto diktatoriko kathestos pou kuberna te khora me apisteute biaioteta, rikhnetai ste phulake se sunthekes apolutes apomonoses. Uphistatai phrikta basanisteria, metaxu ton opoion kai sterese trophes. Tou kratoun suntrophia oi saures tou kephaliou tou. Alla autoi oi monadikoi tou philoi einai kai ekeinoi pou mporoun na ton threpsoun. O eroas, pistos boudistes, aisthanetai enokhos pou skotonei tis saures. Alla gia na epibiosei, prepei na phaei...
To "Kloubi tes sauras" parousiazei me exokho logotekhniko uphos kai thaumaste istorike akribeia ten anekouste bia pou uphistatai o laos tes Birmanias, kai apotelei umno sten antistase, psukhike kai somatike, enantion tes turannias kai tes adikias, enantion tes tapeinoses tou anthropou.
Mesa apo ten perigraphe tes philias tou eroa m' enan dodekakhrono pou megalonei sto khoro tes phulakes kai katorthonei na spasei ten apomonose tou, alla kai tes entimes stases enos phrourou, ekphrazetai e empistosune ston anthropo kai exumneitai e gennaiodoria, apodeixe oti e kale logotekhnia mporei na sunuparkhei me ta kala aisthemata."�
�... Ena mpoumpouneto akousteke ston kokkino brakho ki epeita e ge anapedese ki arkhise na trantazetai me statherous spasmous, eno o thorubos megalone exisou stathera. O Ralph tinakhteke ston aera, xanapese, sprogmenos pano sta kladia. Dexia tou, kai molis liga metra parapera, oloklere e sustada egeire kai oi rizes ourliaxan kathos bgekan entelos exo apo to khoma. Eide kati kokkino pou gurize arga sa mulopetra. Epeita to kokkino pragma perase, ogkodes ki argokineto san elephantas, ki exaphanisteke pros te thalassa..."�	
�	Brabeumeno me to brabeio Goncourt to 1984, to koruphaio autobiographiko muthistorema tes Margkerit Nturas apotelei mia sugklonistike muese ston erota kai sten aphupnise tou aisthesiasmou. Me phonto ten upobletike atmosphaira tes apoikiakes Indokinas tou mesopolemou, e suggrapheas aphegeitai te skhese anamesa se ena leuko koritsi 15 eton kai enan plousio Kinezo pou ekhei ta dipla tes khronia. E istoria tous apsepha olous tous kanones ton phuletikon kai koinonikon diakriseon kai einai mia adiexode proklese: to koritsi tha epistrepsei ste Gallia kai autos o erotas tha meinei meteoros kai alesmonetos.
Alla "O erastes" den einai mono e istoria ekeinou tou protou kai alesmonetou erota. E aphegese tes Nturas aplonetai se polla epipeda: anakalei te bia kai ten odune pou biose mesa sten oikogeneia tes, milaei gia te banausoteta tou megalou adelphou, gia ta antikrouomena sunaisthemata pros te metera, gia te latreia ston mikro adelpho. Ebdomenta khronon pia, e suggrapheas mporese na anasurei tharralea anamneseis pou xanapheran sten epiphaneia epoduna aisthemata. Kai to ekane teleiopoiontas tautokhrona auto to monadiko stul graphes pou kharakterizei olo to ergo tes."�
�Ston Purro kai tous allous Samourai, elaphra as einai e skepse.
Paramuthas apo tous ligous, epaggelmatias oneiropolos, kalos graphias kai kakistos otan pataei ste ge, o Alkibiades Pikros tha thelesei na apokruptographesei aute ten aphierose ston patera tou, pou pethane se autokinetistiko atukhema otan etan ennia khronon.
ATUKhEMA! ATUKhEMA;
O eroas mas tha kataduthei sto oikogeneiako parelthon pou ekhei stigmatistei apo mia akoma tragodia: e metera tou e Philio ephuge otan ekeinos etan mono ligon menon. Etan e teleutaia trion gunaikon pou dolophonethekan, kata surroe, prin trianta pente khronia.
TUKhAIA! TUKhAIA;
O Alkibiades tha khothei ston maiandro.
Okhi khoris kostos.
Khreiazontai tolme, ta palia biblia. Eidika, ta palia biblia ton allon. Pote den xereis ti mporei na kruboun."�
�E Annezo genna ton Staure. O Staures apokta mia kore, ten Anna. E Anna megalonei ena ektheto koritsaki, ten Ariadne. Oi zoes tous, gemates peripeteies kai anatropes, kaluptoun mia khronike periodo apo to 1900 os tis meres mas. Apo tous Sumiakous sphouggarades kai ton Ephebo ton Antikutheron sto doulemporio ton duton. Apo to arkhontiko tes Udras stis phtokhogeitonies tes Drapetsonas, opou tha biosoun ten akraia ekmetalleuse kai tapeinose. Apo ton bombardismeno Peiraia tou '41 ste mikroastike Kupsele. Apo ten oraia Naupakto kai ton Kurio Ntikens stis diadeloseis tes Athenas tou 2010.
Ena panorama tes Elladas tou 20ou aiona kai ton gegonoton pou semadepsan ton topo kai tous anthropous. Prosopa uparkta emplekontai kai sunodoiporoun me alla, muthistorematika. Semantikes stigmes tes Istorias, pou diamorphosan kai kathorisan te zoe ton eroon, me te mneme -sullogike kai atomike- na plaisionei ton mikrokosmo tous."�
�O mikros Nikolas einai ena phusiologiko paidi: likhoudes, kabgatzes, alla polu eugenikos, pou tou aresei to podosphairo kai oi plakes me tous philous tou...
Kai ola auta mas ta aphegeitai opos tha ta aphegountan ena paidi.
Gi' auto mas kanei kai gelame.
O klasikos eroas pou antiprosopeuei to authentiko paidi se kathe epokhe erkhetai stis Ekdoseis Patake. E seira xekinaei me pente titlous (treis to 2014 kai duo to 2015) me tis agapemenes istories tou Mikrou Nikola se nea metaphrase. Kathe biblio perilambanei extra uliko (arkheiako uliko kai ntokoumenta e mia anekdote istoria).
Apo to 1956 pou protoemphanisteke, o mikros Nikolas magepse tous anagnostes. Apo komiks, ginetai eikonographemene istoria, biblio, tainia. Metaphrazetai se 30 khores kai xeperna ta 10.000.000 antitupa! Enas apo tous pio goeteutikous eroes pou ekhei prokalesei to gelio se genies anagnoston, apo ta mikra paidia mekhri tous goneis kai tous pappoudes."�
�E seira ton ekdoseon METAIKhMIO <>xekinaei me ton suggraphea kai tragoudopoio Thoma Korobine, o opoios anthologei keimena, kurios apo to euru phasma tes Neoellenikes Logotekhnias tou 20ou aiona. Ston skhoinotene apo kardias prologo tou o anthologos exegei tous logous gia tous opoious epilegei tous sugkekrimenous suggrapheis, te skhese tou me pollous ap' autous, ton tropo pou ekhoun epereasei, palioteroi kai neoteroi, ton idio kai tis demiourgies tou. Ousiastika prokeitai gia mia exomologetike proza, e opoia me okhema ten epiloge keimenon allon demiourgon kai prosopikon apotimeseon tou ergou tous apokta autobiographike kai parallela grammatologike axia logotekhnikon apaiteseon."�
�Izampel
Ena plasma gennemeno sta skotadia. Medenismeno apo ten arkhe tes zoes tou. Ena koritsi plasmeno apo theous kai daimones. Pou megalose - egkataleimmeno apo ten idia tou te mana - me ton ekhthro tou, pou to etrephe me misos. Mia gunaika pou mporei na metousiothei se phos kai na dialusei kathe skotadi. Pou mporei omos kai na anoixei tis pules tes kolases kai na bouliaxei ste diastrophe. Mia gunaika pou apo thuma ginetai thutes. Suzugos kai erastes, pionia tes idias partidas.
Sten akre tou nematos.
Poios tha bgei alobetos apo aute ten paranoia;
Poios mporei na xerizosei tous daimones pou uparkhoun sten psukhe mias gunaikas pou e athooteta ten egkateleipse molis sta dekatria tes khronia;"�
�Me phonto te dekaetia tou '30, to "Antio Berolino" zontaneuei te lampse kai ton bourko, ten uperbole kai ten katapiese tes berolinezikes koinonias. O Isergount skiagraphei anthropines zoes pou apeilountai apo ten anodo tou nazismou: mia plousia ebraia kleronomo, te Natalia Lantaouer, ena omophulophilo zeugari, ton Piter kai ton Oto, kai ena khameno paidi tes agglikes kales koinonias, ten exokha parakmiake Sali Mpoouls.
Sto biblio basisteke e thrulike kinematographike tainia "Kampare" (1972), e opoia apespase sunolika okto brabeia Oskar me protagonistria os Sali Mpoouls te Laiza Mineli."�
�The number-one New York Times-bestselling novelist Patricia Cornwell is known the world over for her brilliant storytelling, the courage of her characters, and the state-of-the-art forensic methods they employ.
In this headline-making new work of non-fiction, Cornwell turns her trademark skills for meticulous research and scientific expertise on one of the most chilling cases of serial murder in the history of crime-the slayings of Jack the Ripper that terrorized 1880s London. With the masterful intuition into the criminal mind that has informed her novels, Cornwell digs deeper into the case than any detective before her-and reveals the true identity of this elusive madman.
Enlisting the help of forensic experts, Cornwell examines all the physical evidence available: thousands of documents and reports, fingerprints, crime-scene photographs, original etchings and paintings, items of clothing, artists' paraphernalia, and traces of DNA. Her unavoidable conclusion: Jack the Ripper was none other than a respected painter of his day, an artist now collected by some of the world's finest museums."�
�"E Mpini, akoma ki an den khreiazotan khremata, kathe phora pou pernouse apo ena automato trapeziko mekhanema stamatouse ki ekane analepseis. Ustera edine ta khartonomismata ston Alnto gia na ta xanabalei sto logariasmo tes. Den mporouse na sugkratethei. Etan kati apithano. Ebazes ten kartoula, patouses merika koumpia ki ebgainan ta khartonomismata. Ti mageia, ti khara! Kai e Mpini eniothe allos anthropos. Den etan pia to atukho koritsaki, me ton mpampa tes pou eikhe phugei ston polemo, me ten asplakhne mana, me ta mpalomena phorematakia, tis kakes daskales, to anamorphoterio, te phulake...
Ta plektra sta magika mekhanemata ten ekanan na niothei apozemiomene. Tora pia e Mpini zouse ste demokratia, eikhe anthropina dikaiomata...""�
�- Se ponesa;
- Okhi.
- Eisai thumomenos mazi mou;
- Okhi.
Etan aletheia. Ekeine te stigme ola etan aletheia, ephoson zouse te skene sten protogene tes katastase, khoris na bazei erotemata ston euato tou, khoris na prospathei na katalabei, khoris kan na upopsiazetai oti tha uperkhe mia mera kati pou tha eprepe na katalabei. Okhi monon ola etan aletheia, alla ola etan pragmatika : ekeinos, to domatio, e Antre pou paremene xaplomene sto akatastato krebati, gumne me anoikhta ta skele kai to skouro ephebaio tes ap'opou kulouse ena nama apo sperma. [...]
Oi lexeis den eikhan kamia apolutos semasia. Milousan gia ten apolause na miloun kai mono, opos milaei kaneis meta ton erota, me to kormi akoma se diegerse, to kephali ligo adeio.
Ekeine te mera sto mple domatio tou xenodokheiou o Tonu kai e Antre koubentiazoun meta ten erotike praxe. "An xanabriska ten eleutheria mou...tha xanabriskes ki esu te dike sou;" O Tonu den apanta sten erotese. O anakrites kai o psukhiatros theloun tora na katalaboun. Na katalaboun giati o Tonu meta ap'auten ten sunantese apepheuge ten eromene tou. Giati ephuge xaphnika se diakopes me te suzugo kai ten kore tou. Giati ten emera tes tragodias eikhe exaphanistei. O Tonu den apanta stis eroteseis alla xanazei tous menes pou kulesan meta ten teleutaia tou sunantese sto mple domatio. "Tha xanabriskes ki esu ten eleutheria sou;" Oi enorkoi pou th' apophanthoun gia ten enokhe tou Tonu den ekhoun kamia amphibolia os pros ten apantese.
Enas Simenon anapantekhos opou xanabriskoume oles tis aretes pou ton katestesan enan apo tous megaluterous suggrapheis tou 20ou aiona. Dunate ploke, bathia psukhographia ton eroon, upodeigmatike dome. Ena muthistorema pou axizei na to anakalupsete. Trakhu, taragmeno kai apisteuta monterno."�

