"... Diabasa to biblio sas kai thelo na sas sugkharo gia ta exairetika tou proteremata. Nomizo pos kaneis den ekhei kheiristei to thema tes paidikes elikias opos eseis. Den ekhei milesei gia ten kruphe sklerada, gia to aorato auto migma tes phantasias kai tes pragmatikotetas, m' enan tropo toso anoikhto kai aprosdoketo. Mou erthane sto nou o Proust, o Jerzy Kosinski kai o Lewis Carroll... Eseis, omos, ekhete brei edo mia aletheia pou kanenas ap' autous tous treis suggrapheis den epiase. Perimeno me anupomonesia to epomeno sas biblio." (Apospasma apo gramma tou John Updike)
"... Kamia analuse tes "Kassandras kai tou Lukou" den mporei na exegesei te goeteia kai ten ainigmatikoteta tou bibliou. Proto muthistorema tes Margaritas Karapanou, "E Kassandra kai o Lukos", einai mia apo tis spanies demiourgies pou genniountai musteriodos, khoris kanena proegoumeno. To biblio einai prototupo, tromakhtiko, olokleromeno. Epheuriskei te dike tou istoria, mpainei se ephialtikes katastaseis kai bgainei, opos anakateuei to oneiro me ten pragmatikoteta. "E Kassandra kai o Lukos" einai ena mikro, neurodes muthistorema me mia teleia aisthese tes tekhnikes. Den einai pote sunaisthematiko, omorpho e paraphouskomeno. E Margarita Karapanou katalabainei pos mia aphegese den einai para "leptomereia, leptomereia, leptomereia"."
(Apospasma apo kritike tou Jerome Charyn (New York Times)"�
�Martios 1948: o dekakhronos Perikles Adamos ginetai marturas tes stugnes dolophonias ton gonion tou apo tous stratiotes tou Ethnikou Stratou kata te diarkeia tou Emphuliou. Ekhontas khasei ta panta, diapheugei me tous antartes sta bouna tes Eurutanias. Kunegemenos, kato apo antixoes sunthekes, tha zesei apo konta to misos, ton phobo, ten apoleia, ton pono, ton thanato.
Exenta khronia argotera, tha aphegethei ten istoria tou s' enan nearo ereunete, anazetontas ste mneme tou anthropous, topous kai gegonota.
Grammeno me gregorous ruthmous, saspens kai kinematographiko realismo pou kathelonei, to muthistorema parakolouthei ton agona ekeinou tou paidiou na khtisei apo ten arkhe te zoe tou, paleuontas me ta phantasmata pou stoikheiosan ten psukhe tou."�
�Otan e zoe apophasisei na paixei ta niata sou se deutere ektelese den mporeis na tes arnetheis ena tetoio doro. Etsi, meta to khorismo mou me te Mare, bretheka khoris na to katalabo anamesa se palious summathetes kai gunaikes tes nukhtas na xanazo ta neanika mou pathe ekdotos se katakhreseis kai edones. Enas phonos omos allazei ta dedomena kai to doro ginetai ephialtes..."�
�Aldebaran onomasan oi Arabes ton pleon lampero astera ston asterismo tou Taurou.
Kapoios pistepse pos o erotas tha ton anebasei ekei pano, omos gkremisteke epeide kapoios allos den akolouthese kai menei ste ge phulakismenos (den gnorizei an ton ekleidosan mesa e ton aphesan ap' exo) se enokhes kai tupseis* eremen tou enokhos.
Omos, mesa apo mia magike, plere thaumaton anabase, me khalinous ten katanoese kai ten paradokhe pos einai uparkto kai ekeino to eidos erota pou autos agnoei kai opou den metekhei, tha axiothei ton Aldebaran, me suntrophous tou isobious apla kai megaleiode pragmata, opos to khioumor, e agape, e philia."�
�Einai to proto biblio tou Orkhan Pamouk. Ekdotheke to 1982, kerdise to brabeio muthistorematos Orkhan Kemal kai proanaggellei ten katopine lampre suggraphike poreia tou nompelista pia Pamouk.
To muthistorema kaluptei te zoe trion genion mias oikogeneias apo tis arkhes tou aiona, ta teleutaia khronia tes basileias tou soultanou Ampntoulkhamit, mekhri tis meres mas.
O Tzebntet mpee einai idioktetes mikrou emporikou katastematos ki enas apo tous protous Mousoulmanous emporous, pou stokhos kai philodoxia tou einai na ginei plousios kai na apoktesei mia sugkhrone oikogeneia "Dutikou" tupou kai nootropias. E istoria tou Tzebntet mpee kai ton gion tou einai, kata mia ennoia, kai e istoria tes idiotikes zoes ta khronia tes Tourkikes Demokratias.
Sto panoramiko auto muthistorema, perigraphontai ta esoterika ton spition, o kainourgios tropos zoes stis polukatoikies, oi iskhures, ekdutikismenes oikogeneies, ta kuriakatika apogeumata guro apo to radiophono, oi boltes gia psonia sta magazia sto Mpegioglou, oi agapes kai ta pathe tes anerkhomenes astikes taxes tes tourkikes koinonias.
"Otan apophasisa oti tha gino suggrapheas", leei o Orkhan Pamouk sta "Alla khromata" ("E sunenteuxe sto Paris Review"), "den exera ti ethela na grapso. Malista, ekana ki ena-duo lathos xekinemata. Ekho akome tis semeioseis mou. Epeita apo exi menes omos eikha ede to proskhedio tou bibliou pou ekdotheke telika: "Tzebntet mpee kai uioi". Einai mia oikogeneiake sagka. Opos e Forsyte saga tou Tzon Gkalsgouorthi e oi Mpountenmprok tou Tomas Man."�
�Stis 16 Apriliou 2004 oi kalogeroi se mia mone sto Agion Oros anakaluptoun entromoi mesa se keli ena ptoma. An skephtei kaneis oti to meros auto gia pano apo 1.000 khronia apagoreuetai na to patesei podi okhi mono gunaikas alla akoma kai zoou thelukou genous, tote ginetai phanero ti salo prokalei e eidese pos to ptoma auto anekei se mia kopela.
Oi upoptoi einai o ktetoras tou keliou Nephonas, pou theoreitai peripou agios, kai o gerontas Gedeon, pou allo oneiro den ekhei para na dei na kumatisei xana e ellenike semaia sten Konstantinoupole.
Erotiko skandalo; Ethniko skhedio; Daktulos tou satana; E mepos kati pou xepernaei ki aute akoma te phantasia tou suggraphea;
To Pandaimonio ekhei kerdisei to endiapheron ton xenon ekdoton kai ekdotheke ede sta italika apo ton oiko CROCETTI EDITORE, eno suntoma prokeitai na ekdothei sten Elbetia gia te germanike glossa apo ton oiko Waldgut Verlag."␀␀0@"␀␀p@"	
